{"4787530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Harrowgate Asylum", "steam_appid": 4787530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5038910], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787530/extras/49685ccb91becdb9c3c611e1a422de61.avif?t=1787955859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787530/extras_big/49685ccb91becdb9c3c611e1a422de61.avif?t=1787955859 width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>HARROWGATE ASYLUM: Echoes of the Past </strong>is a first-person stealth survival horror where every mistake could be your last. Trapped in a sinister, abandoned place, there is no room for heroism—fighting back means certain death. Your only objective is to survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rustle and shifting shadow is a genuine threat. To escape, you must master the art of remaining unseen. Use the environment to your advantage: study the patrol routes of the horrors that hunt you, slip between hiding spots, and literally hold your breath when danger inches past you in the dark. If you break stealth, your only hope is to run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Stealth:</strong> Avoid line of sight, manage your noise, and use the shadows to evade deadly creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgiving Encounters:</strong> There is no combat. Getting caught leads to brutal consequences. Run, hide, or die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles:</strong> Scavenge for keys, interact with hidden mechanisms, and unlock doors to progress deeper into the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oppressive Immersion:</strong> Realistic graphics and a bone-chilling sound design create a suffocating 